= Santiago Carrillo

Santiago Carrillo is the young firebrand who leads the Federación de Juventudes Socialistas, the party's youth wing, and a rising voice of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s revolutionary left. He advocates a course of open class struggle and unity with the communist youth.

- @class_struggle
- @socialist_youth
- @against_toleration
- @root: Return to main

@class_struggle
title: Rally for class struggle
subtitle: The core of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span> should be the struggle of the workers against the propertied classes.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 5; smallholder_psoe -= 3; urban_middle_psoe -= 2; radical_relation -= 3; ceda_relation -= 3

Our message of class struggle appeals to the militant wing of the working class, while alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]


@socialist_youth
title: Support the <span style="color: #c00000;">Socialist</span> Youth
subtitle: We must shed our reputation as a party for old men by funding the youth organizations. -1 resources
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if resources <= 0 : Not enough resources. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and resources > 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources -= 1; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 3; ugt_militia_strength += 50; ugt_militia_militancy += 0.025; industrial_psoe += 2*(1-dissent); urban_middle_psoe += 1; radicalization += 1

Carrillo builds up the Socialist Youth, drawing support to the left and stiffening the militancy of the workers' militias.

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
subtitle: Withdraw the PSOE's support and force a government crisis.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_toleration == 0 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not currently tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_toleration
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; psoe_toleration = 0; left_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 4; coup_progress += 2; urban_middle_psoe -= 3; smallholder_psoe -= 3; catholic_psoe -= 3; reformist_dissent += 8; left_dissent -= 5; izq_rep_relation -= 8; radical_relation -= 4

Carrillo has grown tired of propping up a government the party does not lead. We withdraw our support and throw the government into crisis.

